About the images of the sample case
-----------------------------------
The photos in cases/chupacabras-labranza/photos/ were generated with AI image tools
(some were then edited by hand) and do not show real places or people. They are covered by
the content license above. Any case that includes AI-generated images should say so in
its own folder, as the sample case does.

The people, companies, places and events in the sample case are fictional. Any
resemblance to real ones is a coincidence.
